{
  "about": "Terminals for policyDenialFromTerminal (Node) and policy_denial_from_terminal (Python). A denial is a failed terminal whose error is policy_rejected or policy_unavailable and whose errorDetails has a stage of input or response. expected is null or { code, stage, reason?, policyIds }. Both SDKs read this file.",
